The r_1 and the r_0 and the r_16 and the r_15 and the r_17 and the r_18 and the r_19 and the r_2 and the r_23 and the r_22 and the r_24 and the r_25 and the r_27 and the r_26 and the r_28 and the r_29 and the r_30 and the r_3 and the r_31 and the r_32 and the r_33 and the r_34 and the r_36 and the r_35 and the r_37 and the r_38 and the r_40 and the r_39 and the r_41 and the r_44 and the r_43 and the r_46 and the r_45 and the r_47 and the r_48 and the r_49 and the r_50 and the r_51 and the r_52 and the r_53 and the r_55 and the r_54 and the r_59 and the r_58 and the r_60 and the r_61 and the r_62 and the r_69 and the r_68 and the r_8 and the r_7 and the r_9 and the r_10 and the r_11 and the r_12 and the r_13 and the r_14 and the r_20 and the r_21 and the r_4 and the r_42 and the r_5 and the r_56 and the r_57 and the r_6 and the r_63 and the r_64 and the r_65 and the r_66 and the r_67 are privately-named.

